# The SEB pieces dev runs, from the bundle estate/platform.lock pins. One entry per line:
# <piece id> deploys the piece's default render; <piece id>@<profile> deploys that profile of it.
#
# Only the pieces SWITCHED to the bundle, by digest (estate/seb-upgrade.sh writes their
# Applications into gitops/apps/overlays/dev/seb-bundle/). Every other piece is still deployed
# from git by its Application in gitops/apps/overlays/dev/seb-pieces/; listing a piece here before
# its git Application is removed would deploy it twice under the same name. Switch one piece per
# commit: list it, re-run the upgrade, remove its git Application, check Argo's diff is empty.
reference
traefik-accesslog
pdfcraft
talk-hpb
convex
headlamp
reloader
system-upgrade-controller
cluster-dns
cert-manager
platform-rbac
db-backup
external-dns
arc-controller
